							"author": "Redwood Dispatch"
							"pages": [
								"{\"text\": \"OPTIONAL RANGER\\nDUTIES\\n\\nTrack a request from\\nits book to receive a\\nrecorder. Aim into the\\nair and right-click.\\nKeep it in either hand\\nand stay within four\\nblocks for twelve\\nseconds.\"}"
								"{\"text\": \"Read the task in that\\nsame book. You can\\nleave and retry. None\\nof this is required for\\nthe daily story.\\n\\nLost the request?\\n/redwood tasks\\n\\nForgot the task?\\n/redwood objective\"}"
